flowchart TD
    A[User clicks card in collection] --> B[CollectionCardDetail loads]
    B --> C{Card has banned/restricted formats?}

    C -- Yes --> D[Red/yellow summary box renders after Breadcrumb]
    D --> E[Lists affected formats with LegalityBadge chips]

    C -- No --> F[No summary box rendered]

    E --> G[LegalityPanel shows full format grid in right column]
    F --> G

    G --> H[User scrolls to Ban History section]
    H --> I[User expands Ban History]
    I --> J[Events grouped by format with sub-headings]
    J --> K[User sees timeline per format]

    style D fill:#dc2626,color:#fff
    style E fill:#dc2626,color:#fff
    style F fill:#374151,color:#9ca3af
